    "detailed_description": "Alcyon Infinity is a fast shooter/bullet hell with dynamic movement and risk management, as well as crazy electro-neo-classical music.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/914930/extras/40c5bac015108852c6bc384089fd85ac.poster.avif?t=1673872863\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/914930/extras/40c5bac015108852c6bc384089fd85ac.webm?t=1673872863\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/914930/extras/40c5bac015108852c6bc384089fd85ac.mp4?t=1673872863\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Play alone, or plug-in additional Controllers and play with your friends or against them. (1-4 Players)<br><br></li><li> Boost and Drift your way up to the enemies' blindspot<br><br></li><li> Chain kills to level up your combo and multiply your earnings<br><br></li><li> Unlock and upgrade your Weapons and Shield<br><br></li><li> Manage your energy use by always being one step ahead<br><br></li><li> Enemies get stronger as you progress<br><br></li><li> Choose when to end your run, lest the enemies choose for you!</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/914930/extras/7d8b27cac0e7f050b8571d7a7b3a68aa.avif?t=1673872863\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">4 Playable Ships equipped with their own Main and Special Weapons</h2><br><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/914930/extras/6915efc126f12216c76b7844f4aa890c.avif?t=1673872863\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">4 Pilots engaged in all-out War for the control of Alcyon</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Your Mission is to destroy the Omega Battleship, but are you brave enough? </h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/914930/extras/d49d8762eed6e062b1e90be44f87e3f3.avif?t=1673872863\" /></div>",
